   "id": 631841,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "An arrow is shot up into the air from 5 feet, at an initial velocity of 220 feet per second. Which equation can represent the height, <span data-math=\"h(t)\">h(t)</span>, for any time, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span>?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222972,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"h(t)=220+5t-16t^2\">h(t)=220+5t-16t^2</span>"
    },
